"properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.27", "Node name for S&R": "BasicScheduler"}, "order": 40}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [142], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [460.0016784667969, 557.8143310546875], "pos": [-5272.52734375, -1164.5078125], "widgets_values": [["The image is a four-panel layout:  \n\n**Top left corner**: The character's front view features a tailored ensemble styled with traditional inspirations. The jacket is crafted from a deep black fabric, possibly a wool or premium suiting material, with a refined matte finish that accentuates its structured silhouette. It features a mandarin collar that sits neatly, lending a minimalistic yet striking Eastern influence. The centerpiece of the jacket is the row of four asymmetrical toggle closures, each made of black braided cord loops and silver metallic accents, resembling traditional frog fastenings but modernized with sleek detailing. Completing the jacket design are two subtle welt pockets positioned strategically below the toggle closures, blending functionality with style. The trousers align with the jacket in fabric and tone, offering a relaxed yet tailored straight-leg cut that harmonizes with the overall look. The background depicts a clean, urban street lined with modern buildings and minimal activity, emphasizing the character's sophisticated and cultural attire.  \n\n**Top right corner**: The side view reveals additional precision in craftsmanship, with the jacket’s contours highlighting clean, sharp lines and a tailored fit that molds to the character’s body without excess volume. The slight curve at the side hem of the jacket adds a touch of fluidity to its structured nature. From this perspective, the toggles on the jacket remain visible and catch light slightly, showcasing their metallic sheen and ornamental cord design. The trousers fall naturally against the leg, emphasizing their straight-cut design without unnecessary bunching or tapering, creating a balanced and polished look. The street background remains consistent, depicting more of the urban scenery, including faint views of traffic lights and parked cars.  \n\n**Bottom right corner**: The rear view emphasizes the jacket’s seamless construction and sophisticated tailoring. The back panel offers a smooth, uninterrupted plane of fabric, reinforcing the sleek design ethos. The shoulders are tailored to perfection, with precise stitching ensuring a clean fit that flatters the character's posture. The trousers exhibit an impeccable drape, with no distracting creases or embellishments, showcasing the overall polished appearance from behind. The urban street scenery in the background highlights textured pavement and shadow play from nearby structures, further enhancing the modernity of the shot.  \n\n**Bottom left corner**: The full-body photo captures the overall elegance of the attire. The interplay between the jacket’s traditional-inspired design elements and the modern tailoring creates a harmonious fusion of past and present. The structured jacket complements the subtly flowing trousers, offering a look that feels regal yet approachable. The toggles and metallic embellishments serve as focal points without overwhelming the outfit’s clean aesthetic. The mandarin collar elegantly frames the neckline, while the straight-leg trousers add balance. The character is situated against a bustling city street backdrop, with glimpses of pedestrians and shopfronts that paint a picture of contemporary culture meeting refined sartorial traditions."], "The image is a four-panel layout:\n\n**Top left corner: Front view of the character**  \nThe character is dressed in a sleek, all-black ensemble with a slightly avant-garde touch. The jacket is tailored with a structured silhouette and features an unconventional design: safety pins scattered across the front in varying orientations, creating a bold and edgy embellishment. The collar is a slim, stand-up style, adding sophistication. Beneath the jacket, a subtle black shirt is visible, made of smooth fabric with a slightly shiny finish, contributing texture and depth to the outfit. The trousers are classic straight-leg slacks with clean lines and impeccable tailoring, completing the polished look. Footwear consists of chunky-soled black shoes with a glossy finish, adding a modern, industrial aesthetic to the overall appearance. The character stands on a lush green lawn scattered with details such as white balloons and floral arrangements, which create an elegant yet serene outdoor setting.\n\n**Top right corner: Side view of the character**  \nFrom the side, the jacket maintains its structured form, with clean seams that run vertically, creating a streamlined effect. The safety pins are strategically placed to retain their focus on the front side of the jacket, leaving the side relatively unadorned. The trousers fall naturally from the waist down to the shoes, further emphasizing the streamlined theme, with no visible embellishments or details along the side. The chunky shoes are slightly elevated in the back, showcasing their robust construction and glossy shine. The surroundings feature the same picturesque outdoor lawn with carefully arranged chairs, flowers, and balloons, emphasizing a peaceful and celebratory ambiance.\n\n**Bottom right corner: Back view of the character**  \nThe back of the jacket is simple and unembellished, allowing the focus to remain on the unique safety pin details at the front. The structured tailoring and clean lines are evident, with subtle contouring at the shoulders. The trousers maintain their clean, straight silhouette, falling gracefully to the chunky, glossy shoes. The overall back view highlights the minimalist elegance of the ensemble while reflecting its edge through thoughtful detailing visible from the front. The green lawn stretches seamlessly into the distance, complemented by trees and other outdoor elements, reinforcing the tranquil atmosphere.\n\n**Bottom left corner: Full-body photo of the character**  \nThe full-body composition captures the cohesion and balance of the outfit. The juxtaposition of avant-garde safety pin details on the structured, tailored jacket against the polished, minimalist design of the straight-leg trousers creates a sense of modern refinement. The lightly textured sheen of the inner shirt adds depth without overshadowing the safety pin motif. The chunky black shoes ground the outfit, adding a utilitarian yet contemporary feel, perfectly complementing the overall design. The setting is a picturesque outdoor lawn adorned with white chairs, balloons, and vibrantly colored flowers, creating an elegant and idyllic backdrop that complements the character's sophisticated attire."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 141, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 85, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "9f7b3215e6af317603056a9a1666bf6e83e28835", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 44}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [120, 137, 138], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-5259.322265625, -265.4546203613281], "widgets_values": ["You are a fashion photographer\n\nProvide the most detailed description of the clothing in the response\n\nYou must imagine a picture based on the clothing in the image, and strictly follow the following format in your response:\nThe image is a four-panel layout\nTop left corner: the character's front view,\nTop right corner: Side view of the character,\nBottom right corner: Back view of the character,\nBottom left corner: Full-body photo of the character,\n\nThe response should be as detailed as possible, without any opening phrase"], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 128, "label":